    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαφαιρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take away besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δυνατόν τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					3.5
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, <i>take away for oneself besides</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.35
			</span></i>: c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν υἱὸν τὴν οὐσίαν π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					8.42
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be removed as well</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.687
			</span></i>; <i>to be deprived of as well</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				7.8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοὶ ταῖς ψυχαῖς καὶ ταφὴν
					-αφῃρέθησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					19.60
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
